         <span id="page-body"></span>
        <div id="maincontent2" class="article" role="main"> <!-- InstanceBeginEditable name="maincontent2" -->
          <h1>Court Forms</h1>
          
<p>Court forms provided on this website are free to download, and are provided as PDF documents. To view PDF documents, you will need the free <a href="http://www.adobe.com/products/acrobat/readstep2.html">Adobe Reader</a>.</p>  
			  <p>Paper forms can be obtained from any clerk's office. Many paper forms are free. There is a $5 charge  for some forms, such as a Summons, that require the clerk's  signature and court seal. </p>
			  <p>Search the court forms database by clicking the button below. If you cannot locate a form contact&nbsp;<a href="mailto:webmaster@courts.maine.gov">webmaster@courts.maine.gov</a>.</p>
			  <div style="padding: 20px 20px 20px 20px ; text-align: left; font-size: 16px; line-height: 150%; background-color:#fef7e3">
			   <strong>Important note:</strong> Court forms are revised by the Judicial Branch from time to time. The most up-to-date versions of forms are linked on this page. If a court form is required by Rule, Order, or Statute and an outdated version is submitted, it will not be docketed and will be returned as incomplete. <strong>To avoid incomplete filings, use the most current version of the court form. </strong>	    
	    </div>
          <br>
          <center><h3><a href="https://mjbportal.courts.maine.gov/CourtForms/FormsLists/Index" class="roundbutton orange">Search Court Forms</a></h3></center>
        <div class="twocol1big"><h2>Form Packets</h2>
            <p>The following packets of forms have been assembled for convenience.</p>
            <h3>Protection from Abuse &amp; Harassment</h3>
            <p>The following form packets include "A Guide to Protection from Abuse and Harassment Actions." If filing by email, download and complete the &quot;For Email Filing&quot; labeled packets.</p>
            <p><strong>For use when filing ELECTRONICALLY (eFiling or by email):</strong></p>
            <ul>
              <li><a href="https://mjbportal.courts.maine.gov/CourtForms/FormsLists/DownloadForm?strFormNumber=OTH-030"><strong>For Electronic Filing</strong>: Forms to file a Protection from Abuse</a> (PDF)</li>
              <li><a href="https://mjbportal.courts.maine.gov/CourtForms/FormsLists/DownloadForm?strFormNumber=OTH-032"><strong>For Electronic Filing</strong>: Forms to file a Protection from Harassment</a> (PDF)</li>
              <li><a href="https://mjbportal.courts.maine.gov/CourtForms/FormsLists/DownloadForm?strFormNumber=OTH-034"><strong>For Electronic Filing</strong>: Forms to file a Motion to Extend Order for Protection</a> (PDF)</li>
            </ul>
            <p><strong>For use when filing at IN PERSON at the courthouse:</strong></p>
            <ul>
              <li><a href="https://mjbportal.courts.maine.gov/CourtForms/FormsLists/DownloadForm?strFormNumber=OTH-029"><strong>For Paper Filing</strong>: Forms to file a Protection from Abuse</a>&nbsp;(PDF)</li>
              <li><a href="https://mjbportal.courts.maine.gov/CourtForms/FormsLists/DownloadForm?strFormNumber=OTH-031"><strong>For Paper Filing</strong>: Forms to file Protection from Harassment</a>&nbsp;(PDF)            </li>
              <li><a href="https://mjbportal.courts.maine.gov/CourtForms/FormsLists/DownloadForm?strFormNumber=OTH-033"><strong>For Paper Filing</strong>: Forms to file a Motion to Extend Order for Protection</a> (PDF)</li>
            </ul>
            <h3>Family Matters</h3>
            <ul>
              <li><a href="https://mjbportal.courts.maine.gov/CourtForms/FormsLists/DownloadForm?strFormNumber=OTH-039">Forms to file a Complaint for Divorce with Children</a> (PDF) (NOT included: FM-038 Family Matter Summons and Preliminary Injunction; this form must be obtained from a clerk's office for a $5.00 fee)</li>
              <li><a href="https://mjbportal.courts.maine.gov/CourtForms/FormsLists/DownloadForm?strFormNumber=OTH-040">Forms to file a Complaint for Divorce without Children</a> (PDF) (NOT included: FM-038 Family Matter Summons and Preliminary Injunction; this form must be obtained from a clerk's office for a $5.00 fee)</li>
              <li><a href="https://mjbportal.courts.maine.gov/CourtForms/FormsLists/DownloadForm?strFormNumber=OTH-041">Forms to file a Complaint for Parentage, Parental Rights &amp; Responsibilities & Child Support</a> (PDF) (NOT included: FM-038 Family Matter Summons and Preliminary Injunction; this form must be obtained from a clerk's office for a $5.00 fee)</li>
              <li><a href="https://mjbportal.courts.maine.gov/CourtForms/FormsLists/DownloadForm?strFormNumber=OTH-042">Forms to file a Motion to Modify</a> (PDF) </li>
              <li><a href="https://mjbportal.courts.maine.gov/CourtForms/FormsLists/DownloadForm?strFormNumber=OTH-043">Forms to file a Motion to Enforce</a> (PDF)</li>
              <li><a href="https://mjbportal.courts.maine.gov/CourtForms/FormsLists/DownloadForm?strFormNumber=OTH-044">Forms to file a Motion for Contempt</a> (PDF) (NOT included: CV-037 Subpoena for Hearing on Motion for Contempt; this form must be obtained from a clerk's office for a $5.00 fee, or issued and signed by an attorney.)            </li>
            </ul>
            <h3>FED and Recovery of Personal Property </h3>
          <ul>
              <li><a href="https://mjbportal.courts.maine.gov/CourtForms/FormsLists/DownloadForm?strFormNumber=OTH-045">Forms to file a Residential FED</a> (PDF) (NOT included: CV-034 Forcible Entry and Detainer Summons; must be obtained from a clerk's office for a $5.00 fee)</li>
              <li><a href="https://mjbportal.courts.maine.gov/CourtForms/FormsLists/DownloadForm?strFormNumber=OTH-046">Forms to file a Recovery of Personal Property case under the Phased Management Plan (PMP)</a> (PDF) (NOT included: CV-184 Recovery of Personal Property Summons; must be obtained from a clerk's office for a $5.00 fee)          </li>
          </ul>
          <h2>Subpoenas</h2>
          <p>Maine attorneys can submit a request to&nbsp;<a href="mailto:subpoena.request@courts.maine.gov">subpoena.request@courts.maine.gov</a>&nbsp;to be sent blank fillable versions of the following forms via email:</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Subpoena for Production of Documentary Evidence or Tangible Objects by a Nonparty (CR-213) Rev. 07/15</li>
            <li>Subpoena for Attendance of Witness (CR-072) Rev. 03/21</li>
            <li>Witness Subpoena for Trial/Hearing/Deposition/Inspection (CV-035) Rev. 09/22</li>
          </ul>
          <p><strong>Please note:</strong> the email address above <strong>cannot</strong> be used to submit a request for the issuance of a subpoena under the Uniform Interstate Depositions and Discovery Act. See <a href="https://legislature.maine.gov/statutes/14/title14ch15sec0.html">M.R.S. Sections 401-408</a>.&nbsp;</p>
          <p>Self-represented parties must purchase subpoenas from any clerk's office for a $5 fee (see&nbsp;<a href="https://www.courts.maine.gov/rules/text/MRCivPPlus/RULE%2045r.pdf" target="_blank">M.R. Civ. P. 45</a>,&nbsp;<a href="https://www.courts.maine.gov/rules/text/mru_crim_p_plus_2017-5-3.pdf" target="_blank">M.R.U. Crim. P. 17, and M.R.U. Crim. P. 17A</a>). <a href="https://www.courts.maine.gov/courts/find-a-court.html">Find the court nearest you</a>.          </p>
        </div>
          <div class="twocol2small">
